// NIP-060 OP_CHECKSIG_P256: strict-profile P-256 primitive (crypto/p256.h).
// The vector file test/data/p256_vectors.json is generated by
// contrib/p256/gen_p256_vectors.py from the NIP-060 §11 cases, Wycheproof
// (ecdsa_secp256r1_sha256_p1363) and NIST CAVP SigVer [P-256,SHA-256], with
// every expectation checked against an independent Python implementation.
// Wycheproof accepts high-S signatures; the strict profile rejects them as
// SIG_ENCODING and the generator adds their low-S twin as a valid vector.

